# Fortress remote-infra tofu state — never commit.
# Secrets no longer live here: the store is the repo-root
# secrets/secrets.enc.yaml (committed as age ciphertext), facts are
# secrets/facts.json (committed plaintext). Anything committed
# plaintext inside secrets/ is a bug — guarded by the L1 tripwire.
.terraform/
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.*
terraform.tfvars
*.tfplan
.terraform.lock.hcl
